Association StaffDisciplineIncidentAssociation
    documentation "This association indicates those staff who were victims, perpetrators, witnesses, and reporters for a discipline incident."
    domain entity Staff
        documentation "Relates the staff associated with the discipline incident."
    domain entity DisciplineIncident
        documentation "Reference to the discipline incident associated with the staff."
    descriptor DisciplineIncidentParticipationCode
        documentation "The role or type of participation of a student in a discipline incident."
        is required collection
